    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d202">

                <pb facs="1252" n="1094" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1094"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 20, 1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 220.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 198,<anchor n="a"
                        xml:id="d202-f1"/> of the 10th instant, relative to the seizure by a Mexican
                    transport, on a charge of poaching, of the fishing vessel <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Aloha</hi>, belonging to the Gulf Fisheries Company, of
                    Galveston, Texas, I have the honor to inclose copy and translation of a note
                    from the foreign office and of the communication from the department of war and
                    marine therewith transmitted, reporting the status of the case in the
                    courts.</p>
                <pb facs="1253" n="1095" xml:id="pg1095"/>
                <p>I have had no information relative to the case from the consul at Veracruz later
                    than that contained in his report of the 7th instant (inclosure 7 in No. 198);
                    but he will keep me advised as to any further developments.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. E. Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d202-a1.xml" xpointer="d202-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d202-a2.xml" xpointer="d202-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
